- A. Paszke et al. (2019). "PyTorch: an imperative style, high-performance deep learning library". *Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems* 32, 8024–8035.
- J. Chen and J. Revels (2016). "Robust benchmarking in noisy environments". arXiv:1608.04295.
- D. P. Kingma and J. Ba (2015). "Adam: a method for stochastic optimization". *ICLR*. arXiv:1412.6980
